---
// Real HTML/SVG Dotted World Map with Dynamic Luminous Network Animations
// Includes: Traveling Signal Blips, West-to-East Scanning Radar Wave,
// High-Contrast Organic Dot Twinkle, and Multi-Stage Hub Radar Echoes
---

<div class="dotted-map-container relative w-full h-auto select-none overflow-hidden">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 1024 506"
    fill="none"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    class="w-full h-auto max-w-full block"
    aria-label="Interactive Global Trade Network Map"
